          {
            "title": "Question: One indent",
            "id": 107740,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Perché è utile aggiungere un'istruzione <code>if</code> all'interno di una funzione?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Ci permette di modificare il comportamento della funzione in base a una condizione</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">È come aggiungere qualsiasi altra istruzione all'interno di una funzione</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Rende la nostra funzione più breve e facile da leggere</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Ci permette di modificare il comportamento della funzione in base a una condizione.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>In una funzione, <code>if (score &gt; 50)</code> stampa <code>High</code>. Dopo il blocco if, stampa <code>Done</code>.</p><p>La chiami con un punteggio di <code>40</code>. Cosa appare?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Solo <code>Done</code>.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>High</code>, poi <code>Done</code>.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Nessuno dei due messaggi.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Solo <code>Done</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Braces and spaces",
            "id": 107735,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Chiama la funzione con il valore (argomento) che visualizzerà <code>\"Passed!\"</code> nella console.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"checkGrade\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"score\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (score &lt;= \" /><text value=\"65\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Failed...&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" } \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Passed!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"checkGrade(\" /><text value=\"80\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"130\" endIndex=\"132\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"65\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"40\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Passed!\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>80</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Chiama la funzione con un punteggio che raggiunga il ramo <code>Passed!</code>, non quello dell'esito negativo.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"checkGrade\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"score\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (score &lt;= \" /><text value=\"65\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Failed...&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" } \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Passed!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"checkGrade(\" /><text value=\"80\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"130\" endIndex=\"132\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"65\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"40\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"60\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Passed!\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>80</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Indenting the entire block",
            "id": 107734,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Scrivi l'istruzione <code>if</code> in modo che entrambi i messaggi vengano stampati nella console.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"isLying\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"boolean\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Can you trust him?&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (boolean === \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;He's lying.&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" } \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"isLying(\" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"77\" endIndex=\"80\" /><option startIndex=\"81\" endIndex=\"85\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"false\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Can you trust him?\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"He's lying.\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>===</code>, seguito da <code>true</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Code blocks",
            "id": 107733,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Chiama la funzione con l'argomento che darà come risultato un prezzo scontato del 10%.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"discountedPrice\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"cost\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" discount;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (cost &gt; \" /><text value=\"2000\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  discount = cost * \" /><text value=\"0.8\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  cost = cost - discount;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" } \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (cost &gt;= \" /><text value=\"500\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  discount = cost * \" /><text value=\"0.1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  cost = cost - discount;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(cost);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"discountedPrice(\" /><text value=\"800\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"238\" endIndex=\"241\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"2200\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"400\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"720\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>800</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Chiama la funzione con un costo che rientri nella fascia di sconto del 10%, non in quella senza sconto o in quella del 20%.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"discountedPrice\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"cost\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" discount;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (cost &gt; \" /><text value=\"2000\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  discount = cost * \" /><text value=\"0.8\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  cost = cost - discount;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" } \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (cost &gt;= \" /><text value=\"500\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  discount = cost * \" /><text value=\"0.1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  cost = cost - discount;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(cost);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"discountedPrice(\" /><text value=\"800\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"238\" endIndex=\"241\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"2200\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"400\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"500\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"720\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>800</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Multiple instructions",
            "id": 107732,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Completa l'istruzione condizionale per applicare correttamente le tasse allo stipendio passato alla funzione <code>getTaxedSalary()</code> quando è superiore a 2.500.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"getTaxedSalary\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"salary\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (salary &gt; \" /><text value=\"2500\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  salary = salary - (salary * \" /><text value=\"0.15\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" salary;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" income = getTaxedSalary(\" /><text value=\"2800\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(income);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"38\" endIndex=\"53\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"(income &lt; 2500)\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"(income &gt; 2500)\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"(salary &lt; 2500)\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"2380\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>(salary &gt; 2500)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Applica le tasse solo quando il valore ricevuto da <code>getTaxedSalary()</code> supera 2.500, non quando è il successivo risultato <code>income</code> a superarlo.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"getTaxedSalary\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"salary\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (salary &gt; \" /><text value=\"2500\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  salary = salary - (salary * \" /><text value=\"0.15\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" salary;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" income = getTaxedSalary(\" /><text value=\"2800\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(income);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"38\" endIndex=\"53\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"(income &lt; 2500)\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"(income &gt; 2500)\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"(salary &lt; 2500)\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"(salary &gt;= 2500)\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"2380\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>(salary &gt; 2500)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Comparing one value",
            "id": 107878,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Scrivi l'istruzione condizionale per applicare uno sconto per bambini, se appropriato.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"applyChildrensDiscount\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"age\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (age &lt;= \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(age + \" /><text value=\"&quot; year(s): children's discount applies!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"applyChildrensDiscount(\" /><text value=\"6\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"44\" endIndex=\"47\" /><option startIndex=\"48\" endIndex=\"50\" /><option startIndex=\"51\" endIndex=\"53\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"==\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"(\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\")\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"applyChildrensDiscount\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"6 year(s): children's discount applies!\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>age</code>, seguito da <code>&lt;=</code> e infine <code>10</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Applica lo sconto all'età del bambino passata alla funzione, includendo l'età di 10 anni.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"applyChildrensDiscount\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"age\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (age &lt;= \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(age + \" /><text value=\"&quot; year(s): children's discount applies!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"applyChildrensDiscount(\" /><text value=\"6\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"44\" endIndex=\"47\" /><option startIndex=\"48\" endIndex=\"50\" /><option startIndex=\"51\" endIndex=\"53\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"==\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&gt;=\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"11\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"applyChildrensDiscount\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"6 year(s): children's discount applies!\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>age</code>, seguito da <code>&lt;=</code> e infine <code>10</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Comparing two values",
            "id": 107877,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Costruisci la condizione all'interno dell'istruzione <code>if</code> in modo che corrisponda correttamente all'output.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"checkGreater\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"a, b\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (a &gt;= b) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(a + \" /><text value=\"&quot; is greater than or equal to &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + b);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"checkGreater(\" /><text value=\"14\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"13\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"34\" endIndex=\"35\" /><option startIndex=\"35\" endIndex=\"36\" /><option startIndex=\"37\" endIndex=\"39\" /><option startIndex=\"40\" endIndex=\"41\" /><option startIndex=\"41\" endIndex=\"42\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;=\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"===\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"14 is greater than or equal to 13\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>(</code>, seguito da <code>a</code> e poi <code>&gt;=</code>, <code>b</code>, <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Completa la condizione che visualizza il messaggio quando il primo numero è maggiore o uguale al secondo.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"checkGreater\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"a, b\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (a &gt;= b) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(a + \" /><text value=\"&quot; is greater than or equal to &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + b);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"checkGreater(\" /><text value=\"14\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"13\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"34\" endIndex=\"35\" /><option startIndex=\"35\" endIndex=\"36\" /><option startIndex=\"37\" endIndex=\"39\" /><option startIndex=\"40\" endIndex=\"41\" /><option startIndex=\"41\" endIndex=\"42\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;=\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"===\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"14 is greater than or equal to 13\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>(</code>, seguito da <code>a</code>, <code>&gt;=</code>, <code>b</code> e infine <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Greater value",
            "id": 107876,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Scrivi l'istruzione <code>if else</code> per completare la funzione.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"checkEquality\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"a, b\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (a === b) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Numbers are equal&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" } \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Numbers aren't equal&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"checkEquality(\" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"32\" endIndex=\"44\" /><option startIndex=\"86\" endIndex=\"90\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"if (a &gt;= b)\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"else if\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Numbers are equal\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>if (a === b)</code>, seguito da <code>else</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Completa la decisione sull'uguaglianza in modo che gli input uguali usino il primo messaggio e gli altri input il secondo.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"checkEquality\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"a, b\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (a === b) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Numbers are equal&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" } \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Numbers aren't equal&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"checkEquality(\" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"32\" endIndex=\"44\" /><option startIndex=\"86\" endIndex=\"90\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"if (a &gt;= b)\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"else if\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"if (a = b)\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Numbers are equal\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>if (a === b)</code>, seguito da <code>else</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Multiple times",
            "id": 107875,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Visualizza <code>Logging in</code> nella console chiamando la funzione con la password corretta.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"checkPassword\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"pass\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (pass === \" /><text value=\"&quot;party1999&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Logging in...&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" } \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Wrong password, try again.&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"checkPassword(\" /><text value=\"&quot;party1999&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"152\" endIndex=\"165\" /><option startIndex=\"165\" endIndex=\"166\" /><option startIndex=\"166\" endIndex=\"177\" /><option startIndex=\"177\" endIndex=\"178\" /><option startIndex=\"178\" endIndex=\"179\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"pass\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;swordfish&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Logging in...\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>checkPassword</code>, seguito da <code>(</code> e poi <code>\"party1999\"</code>, <code>)</code>, <code>;</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Chiama la funzione della password esistente con la password memorizzata, in modo che visualizzi <code>Logging in...</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"checkPassword\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"pass\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (pass === \" /><text value=\"&quot;party1999&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Logging in...&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" } \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Wrong password, try again.&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"checkPassword(\" /><text value=\"&quot;party1999&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"152\" endIndex=\"165\" /><option startIndex=\"165\" endIndex=\"166\" /><option startIndex=\"166\" endIndex=\"177\" /><option startIndex=\"177\" endIndex=\"178\" /><option startIndex=\"178\" endIndex=\"179\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"pass\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;swordfish&quot;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;party1998&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Logging in...\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>checkPassword</code>, seguito da <code>(</code>, <code>\"party1999\"</code>, <code>)</code> e infine <code>;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: End of a function",
            "id": 107899,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Qual è lo scopo di un'istruzione <code>return</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Restituire un valore da una funzione</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Per visualizzare un valore nella console</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Chiamare una funzione definita in precedenza</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Restituire un valore da una funzione.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Una funzione esegue <code>console.log(price)</code>, poi <code>return price - 5</code>.</p><p>Le passi <code>20</code>. Quale valore riceve il chiamante?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>15</code>.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>20</code>.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Sia <code>20</code> sia <code>15</code>.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>15</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Nothing gets executed",
            "id": 107900,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quando un'istruzione return viene inserita prima delle istruzioni in una funzione, cosa succede quando la funzione viene chiamata?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Le istruzioni dopo l'istruzione return non vengono eseguite</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Le istruzioni prima dell'istruzione return non vengono eseguite</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">La funzione non è valida e non verrà eseguita affatto</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Le istruzioni dopo l'istruzione return non vengono eseguite.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Una funzione contiene <code>return result;</code> seguito da <code>console.log(result);</code>. Quando viene eseguita, cosa succede alla riga di visualizzazione?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Non viene eseguita perché la funzione ha già restituito il valore.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Viene eseguita prima che il valore restituito venga inviato al chiamante.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Rende la funzione non valida.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Non viene eseguita perché la funzione ha già restituito il valore.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Multiple return statements",
            "id": 107901,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quale/i istruzione/i return viene/vengono eseguita/e in questo codice?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"increaseByTen\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"number\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;Let's increase &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + number + \" /><text value=\"&quot; by ten.&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" number + \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" result = increaseByTen(\" /><text value=\"29\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(result);\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Let's increase 29 by ten.\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">La prima istruzione return</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">La seconda istruzione return</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Entrambe le istruzioni return</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">La prima istruzione return.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Scambi le due righe <code>return</code> e mantieni invariata la chiamata. Quale valore viene ora assegnato a <code>result</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"increaseByTen\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"number\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;Let's increase &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + number + \" /><text value=\"&quot; by ten.&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" number + \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" result = increaseByTen(\" /><text value=\"29\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(result);\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Let's increase 29 by ten.\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>39</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>\"Let's increase 29 by ten.\"</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">I due valori vengono combinati.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>39</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Return in if statements",
            "id": 107909,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Visualizza il messaggio <code>With honors</code> posizionando le istruzioni return nel posto corretto.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"hasHonors\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"grade\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (grade &gt;= \" /><text value=\"75\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;With honors&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;Without honors&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(hasHonors(\" /><text value=\"98\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"));\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"50\" endIndex=\"71\" /><option startIndex=\"76\" endIndex=\"100\" /><option startIndex=\"101\" endIndex=\"102\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\")\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"With honors\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>return \"With honors\";</code>, seguito da <code>return \"Without honors\";</code> e infine <code>}</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Restituisci <code>With honors</code> per un voto idoneo e restituisci l'altro messaggio solo dopo la fine della condizione.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"hasHonors\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"grade\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (grade &gt;= \" /><text value=\"75\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;With honors&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;Without honors&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(hasHonors(\" /><text value=\"98\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"));\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"50\" endIndex=\"71\" /><option startIndex=\"76\" endIndex=\"100\" /><option startIndex=\"101\" endIndex=\"102\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\")\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"return &quot;No honors&quot;;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"With honors\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>return \"With honors\";</code>, seguito da <code>return \"Without honors\";</code> e infine <code>}</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Catch last case",
            "id": 107910,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Esegui l'ultima istruzione return inserendo il valore corretto.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"setOven\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"temp\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (temp &lt; \" /><text value=\"375\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;Too cold&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" } \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (temp &gt; \" /><text value=\"425\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;Too hot&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;Just right&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" result = setOven(\" /><text value=\"400\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(result);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"161\" endIndex=\"164\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"300\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"500\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Just right\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>400</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Restituisci <code>Too cold</code> sotto <code>375</code> e <code>Too hot</code> sopra <code>425</code>.</p><p>Completa entrambi i confronti e scegli un input che restituisca <code>Just right</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"setOven\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"temp\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (temp &lt; \" /><text value=\"375\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;Too cold&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" } \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (temp &gt; \" /><text value=\"425\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;Too hot&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;Just right&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" result = setOven(\" /><text value=\"400\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(result);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"35\" endIndex=\"36\" /><option startIndex=\"82\" endIndex=\"83\" /><option startIndex=\"161\" endIndex=\"164\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;=\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&gt;=\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"300\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"500\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Just right\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>&lt;</code>, seguito da <code>&gt;</code> e infine <code>400</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
